WEBVTT

00:08:57.871 --> 00:09:01.871
including California, Vermont,
New Jersey, Hawaii.

00:09:02.746 --> 00:09:07.121
All have expanded options
for voting at home this year, in 2020.

00:09:07.829 --> 00:09:09.704
Americans are resilient.

00:09:10.246 --> 00:09:13.996
We need a voting process
that is also resilient --

00:09:13.996 --> 00:09:15.537
from a pandemic,

00:09:15.579 --> 00:09:17.037
from burdens and barriers,

00:09:17.079 --> 00:09:19.412
from inequities, from unfairness,

00:09:19.454 --> 00:09:20.829
from foreign adversaries

00:09:20.829 --> 00:09:23.329
and from administrative deficiencies.

00:09:23.371 --> 00:09:27.954
Across the country, voters are choosing
to vote at home in record numbers.

00:09:28.537 --> 00:09:29.746
It is safe,

00:09:29.787 --> 00:09:31.246
it is secure,